aper/scientific-evidence`\n- bundle_present: `True`\n- verification_report: `work/results/t07/codex/20261113_154315/paper/scientific-evidence/verification-report.json`\n- total_references: `188`\n- resolved_references: `75`\n- anchored_references: `113`\n- dangling_references: `0`\n- manifests_checked: `17`\n\n## Agentic evidence audit\n- checked: `True`\n- verdict: `pass`\n- finding_count: `0`\n- summary: Main-text and supplementary claims match the grounded evidence and preserve failed qualification, missing-output limitations, and conditional comparison scope.\n\n## Soft warnings\n- figures[1] PNG width too small: 1650 < 2400\n- figures[2] PNG width too small: 1650 < 2400\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
